--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications by module
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

gwt-bootstrap3
gwt-bootstrap3-extras
gwt-bootstrap3-showcase
    Dependency and toolchain maintenance of the upstream sources. The Java API,
    package names, GWT module names and Bootstrap 3 markup are preserved; the
    build targets org.gwtproject GWT 2.13.1, Bootstrap 3.4.1 and jQuery 3.7.1.

gwt-bootstrap5
gwt-bootstrap5-extras
gwt-bootstrap5-themes
gwt-bootstrap5-showcase
    Derived from the GwtBootstrap3 sources and substantially modified: moved to
    the io.instanto.bootstrap5 package namespace, re-targeted at Bootstrap 5 markup,
    class names and data-bs-* attributes, with jQuery plugin calls replaced by
    Bootstrap 5 JavaScript APIs. Widget semantics differ from the originals
    wherever Bootstrap 5 removed or redesigned a Bootstrap 3 concept.

teavm-gwt-compat
    Not derived from GwtBootstrap3. A minimal reimplementation of the
    com.google.gwt.* client API surface the widget sources use, backed by TeaVM
    DOM calls, so those sources compile on both backends.

teavm-bootstrap3
teavm-bootstrap5
    TeaVM backends for the widget sets above. These compile the corresponding
    GWT module's sources, and add TeaVM-specific implementations for the parts
    that depend on GWT compiler features (JSNI bridges to Bootstrap's
    JavaScript, and deferred-binding lookups).

gwt-teavm-compat
    Original to this project. Reimplements, over TeaVM's JSO libraries, the
    subset of the GWT client API that the widget libraries call. Class and
    method names follow GWT's own API (https://github.com/gwtproject/gwt),
    which is likewise licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

